      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "# VRChat's latest response (October 28, 2026)\n\n[Where we’re landing on AI in VRChat](https://ask.vrchat.com/t/where-were-landing-on-ai-in-vrchat/49178) (VRChat Ask)\n\nFill out a short one question survey (linked in the topic) to help determine if you a \"human-authored\" would satisfy your needs.\n\nA “Tools used” field is being considered.",
